<view class="page"><view class="heading">消息</view><view class="sub">沟通教材细节，跟进每一次交易。</view><view class="tabs"><view class="{{tab==='chat'?'active':''}}" data-tab="chat" bindtap="tab">用户聊天</view><view class="{{tab==='notice'?'active':''}}" data-tab="notice" bindtap="tab">交易通知</view></view><block wx:if="tab==='chat'"><view class="card message-row" wx:for="{{conversations}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-product="{{item.productId}}" bindtap="chat"><view class="chat-avatar">书</view><view class="message-info"><view class="row"><text class="title">{{item.other.nickname}}</text><text class="time">{{item.time}}</text></view><view class="sub">{{item.product.title}}</view><view class="preview">{{item.preview}}</view></view><text wx:if="item.unread" class="unread">{{item.unread}}</text></view><view wx:if="!conversations.length&&!loading" class="empty">还没有会话<text>
</text>在教材详情页点击「联系卖家」开始交流</view></block><block wx:else><view wx:for="{{notifications}}" wx:key="id" class="card notice" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="note"><view class="row"><text class="title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="tag" wx:if="!item.read">未读</text></view><view class="note">{{item.content}}</view><text class="time">{{item.time}}</text></view><view wx:if="!notifications.length&&!loading" class="empty">暂无交易通知</view></block><view wx:if="loading" class="loading">正在加载消息…</view></view>
